00:45:30.394 --> 00:45:31.662
Is that the one

00:45:31.662 --> 00:45:32.663
that's in the McRib?
- It was in Subway.

00:45:32.663 --> 00:45:34.198 align:start size:88% position:13%
- Yeah.
- It was in Subway buns.

00:45:34.198 --> 00:45:35.365
It was in a lot of, it's in
