00:45:37.468 --> 00:45:39.203 align:start size:84% position:16%
It's a deemed.
- As a yoga teacher,

00:45:39.203 --> 00:45:41.305
I know food guys are
supposed to kill you.

00:45:41.305 --> 00:45:42.239
- That's right.

00:45:42.239 --> 00:45:44.274
And in Singapore for example

00:45:44.274 --> 00:45:46.777 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is a very you know,
restrictive country,

00:45:46.777 --> 00:45:50.414 align:start size:97% position:3%
if you use that as a food
