00:45:54.618 --> 00:45:56.353 align:start size:84% position:16%
and we allow it here.
- Right.

00:45:56.353 --> 00:46:01.291
- Products like BHT
and our preservatives

00:46:02.159 --> 00:46:03.427
that are not allowed in Europe.

00:46:03.427 --> 00:46:04.661
There's a whole list
