00:46:07.164 --> 00:46:10.467
And so we have to look at
how different countries

00:46:10.467 --> 00:46:12.269
are addressing this and Europe,

00:46:12.269 --> 00:46:15.005
collectively is focusing
on regenerative agriculture

00:46:15.005 --> 00:46:16.306
and changing their system.

00:46:16.306 --> 00:46:18.175
Chile is a great example

00:46:18.175 --> 00:46:19.943
of a country that
has implemented

00:46:19.943 --> 00:46:21.779
a whole series of food policies

00:46:21.779 --> 00:46:24.348 align:start size:94% position:6%
that have had great
impact in reducing obesity

00:46:24.348 --> 00:46:26.083
and ill health

00:46:26.083 --> 00:46:28.485 align:start size:97% position:3%
which are completely
unpalatable in this country.

00:46:28.485 --> 00:46:30.687
So the only way it got done

00:46:30.687 --> 00:46:32.689 align:start size:84% position:16%
was the Vice President
of the Senate

00:46:32.689 --> 00:46:34.792
and the President of the country

00:46:34.792 --> 00:46:37.194
