00:52:05.222 --> 00:52:07.591 align:start size:97% position:3%
and they add all these
benefits to the environment.

00:52:07.591 --> 00:52:09.259
We call it ecosystem services.

00:52:09.259 --> 00:52:11.094
So as humans we extract

00:52:11.094 --> 00:52:14.297
about $125 trillion
a year from nature

00:52:14.297 --> 00:52:16.867 align:start size:97% position:3%
and use it for our purposes,
